    "description": "Same selection and same in-progress Assign screen as the By Group variant, but with Assign By switched back to Contact. The CONTACTS chip row now lists all three underlying senders — Pete, Mike, Rich — since By Contact groups by sender regardless of whether a signal has a WhatsApp group. This is the toggle-back behavior: switching Assign By re-derives the chip list and label (GROUPS ↔ CONTACTS) from the same fixed session:selectedSignalIds, it never re-queries the selection itself."
